{"seq":14,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-min-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/si-01-marrow-agrisupply-site/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T21:47:43.239Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"1df213cf70c8065f6ba58d946c6b6d9862887402c0f0120c6e90723efb65cf89","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","text":"I replied to Pree in a thread in #central-team. The store is **Pine Crossing**.\n\nShe posted it there herself on 9 June: the morning receiver at Pine Crossing said the appointment screen showed only the afternoon shift. A driver had arrived at 7:10 the day before, and they wrote his trailer number on a sticky note. Hollis said he'd check the shift template and ask support to reproduce the problem using the store login. Nothing posted in the channel after that says whether it was fixed.\n\nI also told her not to confuse it with Eastbank. That store's problem is on ticket PD-4821: the door-import file labels doors E1/E2, but their booking sheet uses 01/02.\n\nI only used sources Pree can see herself: #central-team, #central-random and the public Central digests."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791987000.000127"}}
